      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "■ Stage Direction\nSE: Fireworks sounds\n---\n★ Request\nFade to Black",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "■ Stage Direction\nAge: 11th Grade (High School 2nd Year)\nPersonality: Hot-blooded",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "★ Request\nCostume: Tracksuit (Summer)\n(Other girls wear swimsuits at the beach, but Taishin wouldn't put one on voluntarily, so keep her in a tracksuit intentionally)",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "■ Stage Direction\nLaughing",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "★ Request\nCostume: Casual Clothes",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "■ Stage Direction\nAge: 10th Grade (High School 1st Year)\nPersonality: Serious",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "■ Stage Direction\nDrinks water\n---\n★ Request\nWipe\n---\n★ Request\nMotion: Drinks water",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "—You're like a fish.\nDoesn't make a difference whether you're there or not.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Though acting like you totally get it gets on my nerves.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Honestly, it's worrying to watch.\nIf only there were some way for her to unwind...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Why timing like this...?\nWait, did you—",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Going out of your way to a place swarming with crowds... \nUnbelievable. ...Not that I'd ever go in the first place.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Without other people around, you don't have to walk on eggshells.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Hah! Seii!\nSeiyaaa! Seiyaaaaaaaahhh!!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Hah, so this was all part of your plan, huh.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "You still wanna keep going?\n...We've come pretty far out.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "They're not... bad, the fireworks.\nWay easier to watch than in a crowd, anyway.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "To Narita Taishin, I was like a fish.\nYet to her, those words were surely the greatest—",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Apparently, there's a festival today. But for Narita Taishin,\nheading into a packed festival ground probably wouldn't feel like much of a break.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "People are clearing out.\nGuess there's a festival or something today.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Whatever, fine by me.\nThere won't be anyone else around over there, anyway.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...I hate festivals and all that stuff, honestly.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "—The fireworks start at 19:00.\nChecking the time, there are just five, four, three, two seconds to go...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Hah... hah...\nDammit, it's so hot...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Standby?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Yeah, yeah. Just one more rep.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I don't care... makes things easier for me anyway.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Hmm... toward the forest, huh.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "True to her words, it's obvious she's relaxing.\nHaving nobody watching really is what matters most to her, but—",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Huh?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Well, either way's fine.\nYou're just kind of... 'there'.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "All that could be heard was the breeze and the boom of fireworks.\n—Amidst the sound, Narita Taishin quietly spoke.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Hmm... what?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Still, it's a rare chance.\nI'd like her to enjoy it too. If there's a way...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "—Haaaaaahh!!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "As summer training camp enters its climax, the Umamusume are brimming with fierce heat.\nNarita Taishin seems just as dialed in, but—",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "With you, it's... you know—",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "As Narita Taishin said that, lit by the bursting fireworks,\nher profile bore a gentle, subtle smile...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "By that logic, I feel like there's one exception.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "—Going for one more rep before I lose the feel.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Yeah yeah, the festival.\nLet's meet up just before 19:00 when the fireworks start.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "—Nobody here? Perfect.\nI'm pushing all the way to my limit.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Guh... hah.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Sheesh, what are you bringing that up for now?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...What?\nWipe that goofy look off your face.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Hah, hah, hah...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Ah, what about fish, though?\nI wonder if these guys get me... Heh.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "(BANG! BANG...!)",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Yeah, dummy.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "One after another, fireworks burst, painting the night sky.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Whoa...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "As we kept walking, the sun slowly began to set...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "(Whistle~~~~......... BANG!!)",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Either way's fine, if it's you.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "—Alright! That wraps up today's menu, Trainer!\nLike we promised, let's get ready for the festival!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    }
  ],
  "no_wrap": true
}